| Classical: [[Tafl games|Hnefatafl]]; [[Snakes and ladders]]; [[Hyena chase]]{{pb}} Modern: ''[[Cluedo]]''; ''[[Cranium (board game)|Cranium]]''; ''[[Monopoly (game)|Monopoly]]''; ''[[The Game of Life]]''; ''[[Formula D (board game)|Formula D]]''
| <ref name="classical-classification_parlett_1999"/><ref name="gamy-types_dice-breaker_2021"/><ref name="resource-management-games_gameology_current(2025)"/>
