| Displacement
| The main objective is the capture the opponents' pieces. These board games are also often called elimination or war board games.
| [[Chess]]; [[Draughts|Checkers]]; [[Alquerque]]; [[Fanorona]]; [[Yoté]]; [[Surakarta (game)|Surakarta]]
| <ref name="classical-classification_parlett_1999"/>
