| Drafting
| Involve a mechanism where players are presented with a set of options, usually cards, from which they must pick one, thus choosing the best options from a pool, leaving the remainder for the next player to choose from. They combine strategy, quick decision-making, and outguessing opponent players. The drafting mechanism can be a small part of a game, in order to select an ability for use during a round, or the entire decision space for a game.
| ''[[7 Wonders (board game)|7 Wonders]]''; ''[[Blood Rage (board game)|Blood Rage]]''; ''{{ill|Bunny Kingdom|de|Bunny Kingdom}}''; ''[[Citadels (card game)|Citadels]]''; ''[[Exploding Kittens]]''; ''[[Sushi Go!]]''; ''[[Ticket to Ride (board game)|Ticket to Ride]]''; ''{{ill|It's a Wonderful World (board game)|lt=It's a Wonderful World|fr|It's a Wonderful World (jeu de société)}}''
