| Resource management
| The aim is to achieve objectives and gain an advantage through players acquiring, using, and managing a set of resources, which can be anything from physical materials, currency, and points to abstract concepts like time or influence. 
| ''[[Everdell]]''; ''[[Imperial Settlers]]''; ''[[Concordia (board game)|Concordia]]''; ''[[Scythe (game)|Scythe]]''
